From: ReArc Authors
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 load the undocked DevTools toolbox page (ABI 1.54)

tab/074 adopts the undocked frontend's device-mode toolbox, but its page
never loaded. The frontend opens it with window.open, and the toolbox's
renderer forks that devtools:// navigation to the browser through
OpenURLFromTab, which ReArcTabDelegate dropped for every hosted DevTools
contents. With no device_mode_emulation_frame.html, the frontend had
nowhere to show the device toolbar (⌘⇧M only flipped its icon), and it
never reported the undocked page bounds, so the page kept its docked rect.
As Chrome's DevToolsToolboxDelegate::OpenURLFromTab, the toolbox now loads
devtools:// URLs in place; tab/074's FrontendNavigation throttle still
admits only its own page. Frontends still open nothing. No ABI change.

Last rebased: 2026-11-10 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

